{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/86c5d0d4ae49fcdd2b0ebab14931e89c.avif?t=1760046045\" width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a savage wilderness stalked by traitorous mercenaries, then descend into an ancient dungeon where creatures lurk in the shadows. Can you reach the end and Forge the Fates?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.poster.avif?t=1760046045\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.webm?t=1760046045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.mp4?t=1760046045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY MOVE SHAPES THE NEXT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play runes and shift your grid, cast buffs to amplify your power, deal with grid-clogging debuffs, match-3 in a row to trigger bonuses, and plan ahead to set up future turns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE REWARDS, NOT ROADS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way forward, and each battle brings a choice. Will you modify your deck with upgrades, duplicate your runes, visit the shop, or acquire magical talismans?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT RUNES PROTECT - DARK RUNES ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean into the light to fortify and endure, or embrace the dark to strike with ruthless force. Shape your grid to match your style of play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a new deck every run by acquiring new runes after each battle. Test your skills with multiple difficulty levels. Level up your characters, unlock new abilities, and choose your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/c5413f00ac147fe304d8548e487b928a.poster.avif?t=1760046045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/c5413f00ac147fe304d8548e487b928a.webm?t=1760046045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/c5413f00ac147fe304d8548e487b928a.mp4?t=1760046045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try the free demo </strong>to experience the opening chapter of the adventure, featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first playable character, <i>The Phoenix</i>, and his deck of 60 runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 battles, each selected from 2 randomized encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full character leveling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/6fa747a0e5a70a487febc7aa4b101ae3.avif?t=1760046045\" data-has-big width=1600 height=659 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911490?t=1760046045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/fb3c7744c