 chain match-3 bonuses. Pick your hero, master their unique deck, and battle through waves of enemies, culminating in an epic showdown with the final boss!","steam_appid":3911490,"support_info":{"email":"chaoslogicstudios@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.chaoslogicstudios.com/"}